title: "Dynamic size explorer for the Artisse™ Intrasaccular Device"
abstract: >-
  An interactive sizing chart for the Artisse™ intrasaccular device: the compressed
  device height at any aneurysm width, for all twenty sizes, rather than the few
  fixed compression/height pairs the printed sizing sheet lists.
